				<h1 id="versionHeadLine" class="headline">

Elections		</h1>
	
		<div id="cc5f8c90dc-b4cb-431b-90ee-10648f8df655" data-containerid="5f8c90dc-b4cb-431b-90ee-10648f8df655" class="pageContent cpGrid cpGrid24"  data-contentcontainerbreakpoint="30" >
			

		<div class="row outer wide"><!--
--><div class="outer col col24 first last" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="093de28e-2955-497d-84e3-cdd310a9993b">				
	<div class="row nest first last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col24 first last ide5aa13e2-67de-495f-b542-2e5fbd8d7031" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="e5aa13e2-67de-495f-b542-2e5fbd8d7031">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditord6c0cb78-7cf7-4001-aa71-42f670ed5919" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <h2 class="subhead1"><a href="https://www.hayscountytx.gov/873/November-3-2026-General-Election">November 3, 2026 General Election</a></h2><h3 class="subhead2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" aria-level="2" role="heading"><br></h3><h2 data-pasted="true"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/5319"><mark>USPS Election Industry Alert Concerning Executive Order 14399 and the Domestic Mail Manual</mark></a></h2><p><br></p><h3 class="subhead2" aria-level="2" role="heading"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/4627" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Notice of Deadline to File for a Place on the Ballot for the Hays County Appraisal District for the November 3<sup>rd</sup> election</a></h3><p><br></p><h2 class="subhead1">About Us</h2><p data-pasted="true">The mission of the Hays County Elections Office is to serve as a resource for information regarding election administration and voter registration, ensure the proper conduct of elections, promote a diverse workforce and the effective use of assets, and provide a secure and accessible office for the public.</p><p>Elections are the foundation of democracy and good government. They must accurately reflect the intent of the electorate. Access, security, accuracy, privacy, and integrity are vital voter rights.</p><p>We are committed to maintaining public confidence in elections by assuring that every election is conducted in a fair, efficient, and accurate manner with the highest level of integrity and vote security. We are committed to excellence in maintaining up-to-date and accurate voter registration rolls to provide fair and equal opportunities for all qualified voters to participate in the democratic process.</p><h2 class="subhead1">Voter Information</h2><ul><li><a href="/259/Honoring-Veterans" data-pasted="true">Honor a Veteran</a></li><li data-pasted="true"><a href="https://app.enhancedvoting.com/voter/hays-county-TX/bt/track" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Hays Ballot by Mail Tracker</a></li><li><a href="https://goelect.txelections.civixapps.com/ivis-oab-ui/#/login" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">State Ballot by Mail Tracker</a></li><li><a href="https://webservices.sos.state.tx.us/FPCA/index.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Track Your UOCAVA (FPCA) Ballot</a></li></ul><h2 class="subhead1">Resources</h2><ul><li><a href="https://goelect.txelections.civixapps.com/ivis-mvp-ui/#/login" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Am I Registered to Vote?</a></li><li><a href="/254/Campaign-Financial-Reports">Campaign Financial Reports</a></li><li><a href="/260/Local-Officeholders">Jurisdictions and Officeholders</a></li><li><a href="https://www.votetexas.gov/register-to-vote/update-voter-registration.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Register to Vote or Update Your Information Online</a></li><li><a href="https://www.votetexas.gov/voting/need-id.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Required Identification for Voting in Person</a></li><li><a href="https://www.votetexas.gov/voters-with-special-needs/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Voters with Special Needs</a></li><li><a href="https://wrm.capitol.texas.gov/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Who Represents Me?</a></li></ul>
    </div>

